info.description:
Local, read/write REST API for AxeOs-compatible miners (Bitaxe, NerdAxe) on your LAN.
No authentication — internal LAN use only.

Endpoints are grouped by the service answering them: dashboard-api (this binary, default :8080);
remote-dashboard-api (default :8081), a read-only API serving the miners pushed to hashboard.live;
the mailer (default :8082, on the loopback only), reached through dashboard-api.
